  "description": "A Blazor package providing tile components (Tile and LinkTile) for building list and grid layouts. Each tile shows an optional image (with an abbreviation avatar fallback), a title, a clamped description, and an optional footer. Tiles are container-agnostic, size-aware, and use isolated CSS so no additional stylesheet link is required.",
